## ID Ranges File
## QUAY uses human-readable IRIs (PascalCase classes, camelCase properties).
## Numeric ID allocation is not used. IRIs are derived from rdfs:label.
## See quay-label-required-violation.sparql and quay-iri-label-match-violation.sparql.

Prefix: owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>

Ontology: <https://w3id.org/quay/quay-idranges.owl>
